 4. 📸 Pic to go: Eclipse from space 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Animation: CIRA/NOAA A NOAA weather satellite had one of the best seats in (or above) the house for yesterday's total solar eclipse.

 Above, you can see the Moon's shadow fall across the Earth from the Arctic Ocean down to Western Europe. More eclipse photos . 

 
 
